# Play test of Propeller Point (CIPlay propeller_point): no quest - the strip, the cabin, the watch hut, the leather gear
# in its chests, the warthogs
island Propeller Point
offset 0 0
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
walk -20 -16 to 0 -16 to 20 -16 h=2.4
walk -23.75 4 to -23.75 6.5 to -23.75 9.5 h=2.7
read The pilot's log
open Pilot's locker
expect item Equipment_LeatherHelmet 1
read Strip sign
climb 22.25 5.9 h=3.5
read Watch hut log
open Watch hut box
expect item Equipment_LeatherChest 1
open Fuel drum
open Cockpit kit
expect item Equipment_LeatherLegs 1
open Barrel by the sunken plane
dig
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
